unds issue when calculating ray directions. The direction of (+1,+1) from corner (7,3) gets me to (8,4), which is out of bounds, but it's clearly related to the color. This prompted me to analyze the test input, where the container is 3. I'm now examining the coordinates of the 3 in more detail, now that I know the grid size is 12x12, in order to apply ray projections from the relevant corner coordinates.\n\n\n",
